# Build context for deploy/docker/Dockerfile is the repository root. Keep it
# to the two Python libs and the server wrapper: everything else (web bundle,
# node_modules, venvs, docs, caches) would only slow the context upload.
*
!packages/data-adapters/
!packages/mcp-core/
!packages/hf-space/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/tests/
**/*.pyc
packages/hf-space/uv.lock
packages/hf-space/pyproject.toml
packages/hf-space/.ruff.toml
packages/hf-space/Dockerfile
packages/hf-space/fetch_atlases.py
